  "body": "Found while writing the macOS docs (#1236, PR #1237): UI hover strings still say \"Ctrl+Z\" etc. (op_page.rs, machines_pane.rs, geo_page.rs) although the shortcuts bind egui's command modifier (Cmd on macOS).\n\nDone means: hover/hint strings name the platform's key (Cmd on macOS, Ctrl elsewhere) through one helper; structural assertions updated.\n",
